### Kevalon ERP — Module 14: Reports
@baseUrl = http://localhost:5000/api
@token = REPLACE_WITH_ACCESS_TOKEN
@companyId = REPLACE_WITH_COMPANY_ID
@financialYearId = REPLACE_WITH_FINANCIAL_YEAR_ID

### Trial Balance
GET {{baseUrl}}/reports/trial-balance?companyId={{companyId}}&financialYearId={{financialYearId}}
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### Profit & Loss
GET {{baseUrl}}/reports/profit-loss?companyId={{companyId}}&from=2025-04-01&to=2026-03-31
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### Balance Sheet
GET {{baseUrl}}/reports/balance-sheet?companyId={{companyId}}
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### GST Payable Report
GET {{baseUrl}}/reports/gst?companyId={{companyId}}
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### JSON placeholder exports
GET {{baseUrl}}/reports/gst/export?companyId={{companyId}}
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

###
GET {{baseUrl}}/reports/trial-balance/export?companyId={{companyId}}&financialYearId={{financialYearId}}
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

###
GET {{baseUrl}}/reports/profit-loss/export?companyId={{companyId}}
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

###
GET {{baseUrl}}/reports/balance-sheet/export?companyId={{companyId}}
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
